# hsk android check

After completing Android (`android/`) code changes, before each `hsk android check` run `hsk android format` first.

From the repo root, pass the Android project folder (must contain `gradlew.bat`):

```text
hsk android format android
hsk android check android
```

Or run the same commands with cwd set to `android/` and omit the folder (defaults to `.`).

Run `hsk android format …`, then `hsk android check …`, and fix until it passes.
Repeat this cycle up to **3 times maximum**. If it still fails after 3 iterations, stop and report the remaining errors.

Do not finish while `hsk android check` still fails, unless the failure is environmental (missing JDK/SDK) and cannot be fixed in code.

Equivalent Gradle from `android/`:

- format: `.\gradlew.bat spotlessApply`
- check: `.\gradlew.bat qualityCheck` (`spotlessCheck` + `detekt` + `lintDebug`)
